    "Elle disparaîtra de tous les fils où elle apparaît. Tes XP restent acquis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It'll disappear from every feed it appears in. Your XP stays earned."
