      }
    },
    "Elle disparaîtra du fil du club, avec ses applaudissements et commentaires. Tes XP restent acquis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It will disappear from the club feed, along with its kudos and comments. Your XP stays yours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desaparecerá del muro del club, junto con sus aplausos y comentarios. Tu XP se mantiene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elle reste dans ton historique, mais ne sera plus proposée par défaut sur tes prochaines courses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It stays in your history, but won't be suggested by default on your next runs."
